tpm-fido (0.0~git20260907.1) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Replace the external UHID library with a cancellable native transport.
  * Close device resources on failed startup and serialize daemon shutdown.
  * Add transport, lifecycle, and opt-in kernel integration tests.
  * Serialize auto-switch state and make tray updates safe before startup.
  * Fan out duplicate fingerprint requests and extend their active timeout.
  * Bound fprintd cleanup calls and handle closed signal streams.
  * Add conservative service memory, task, and file descriptor limits.
  * Update maintained repository links to the fork.

 -- Moritz Heiber <moritzheiber@github.com>  Mon, 07 Sep 2026 13:43:02 +0000

tpm-fido (0.0~git20260304) resolute; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging targeting Ubuntu 26.04.
  * Build the daemon as a static Go binary from vendored dependencies.
  * Install a systemd user service that runs tpm-fido in daemon mode.
  * Ship udev rules for /dev/uhid access and snap browser hidraw tagging.
  * Ship a modules-load.d entry for the uhid kernel module.
  * Use fprintd and desktop notification D-Bus APIs directly.

 -- Moritz Heiber <moritzheiber@github.com>  Mon, 31 Aug 2026 09:35:00 +0000
